<v Mike>No. What?

00:01:32.120 --> 00:01:32.980
<v Mike>Oh, oh yeah.

00:01:33.080 --> 00:01:33.940
<v Mike>Yeah. Shit. You're right.

00:01:34.040 --> 00:01:34.940
<v Mike>The whip on the car.

00:01:35.120 --> 00:01:37.080
<v Mike>Right. Damn.

00:01:37.460 --> 00:01:42.400
<v Mike>Good. But not, you know, to be fair, they never made a Castlevania racing game, but maybe they

00:01:42.400 --> 00:01:43.320
<v Sean>should. I understand.

