<v Mike>And then you can buy what I learned the hard way are one-time upgrades.

00:07:13.800 --> 00:07:19.180
<v Mike>Uh, I thought I just started this game incredibly rich and I was like, oh, I'm just going to be able to buy all these upgrades.

00:07:19.480 --> 00:07:24.120
<v Mike>Uh, and you can buy these one-time upgrades like turbo chargers and side armor.

00:07:24.120 --> 00:07:26.980
<v Mike>And, uh, if you can believe this guys missiles.

