00:08:01.700 --> 00:08:13.360
<v Joe>Because it's very easy to win $20,000 coming in first place by every kind of turbo and high speed kit and, you know, make sure your engine and body are maxed out.

00:08:13.420 --> 00:08:18.320
<v Joe>This way you can just kind of, you know, hit any wall and not worry about turning correctly and shit.

