<v Mike>And yeah, you'll come in first, but you will never be able to buy the new car because you'll be spending too much on the upgrade.

00:08:25.420 --> 00:08:33.740
<v Mike>So you have to think about how do I get through races without repairing my gas, my body, my tire, and my engine every single time.

00:08:33.780 --> 00:08:35.060
<v Mike>And that's the neat part of the game.

00:08:35.360 --> 00:08:47.820
<v Sean>Yeah, it's, it's fun. When you mentioned the, the sort of missile and body armor thing, I, I w I saw that in the manual and I was expecting some kind of post-apocalyptic Mad Max situation.

00:08:47.820 --> 00:09:01.800
<v Sean>And it very much is not that like when you, when you go through these, uh, these, these courses, you see like, you know, nice manicured foliage and sort of patio furniture and a cafe.

