00:09:08.780 --> 00:09:19.180
<v Sean>It's very strange, but, um, yeah, I, I kind of liked the, the, the sort of loop here where between each race you have these decisions to make.

00:09:19.480 --> 00:09:25.940
<v Joe>Um, if you're really good at the actual raw driving, you may not like, you could probably save a bit more.

00:09:26.180 --> 00:09:29.600
