00:09:37.460 --> 00:09:43.100
<v Sean>You want to make that money and kind of figuring out what your break even is.

00:09:43.300 --> 00:09:48.700
<v Sean>The missiles are also like, and I think it's good Joe to flag that you only get to use them once.

