<v Sean>It just feels like such a random choice in an otherwise like pretty grounded game.

00:09:54.220 --> 00:09:56.640
<v Mike>I really don't think they were necessary.

00:09:57.200 --> 00:10:02.440
<v Sean>And it's one thing to make it like a, a demolition derby kind of game.

00:10:02.440 --> 00:10:07.760
<v Sean>Um, I think we saw that, uh, you know, not the same style, but like galaxy 5,000.

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:11.000
<v Mike>Um, was it galaxy 5,000 or 50,000?

00:10:11.060 --> 00:10:12.740
<v Mike>5,000. Okay, good.

00:10:12.880 --> 00:10:16.580
<v Sean>Yeah. Oh, it was racing in the 51st century, but yeah, galaxy 5,000.

00:10:16.940 --> 00:10:22.760
