00:12:13.620 --> 00:12:26.940
<v Joe>A lot of times it's best to just like try to beat them on a turn or something because it's usually there's not room for two, uh, down any straightaway unless you're, uh, happen to be perfectly lined up to be side by side with them ahead of time.

