<v Mike>Cause you're most likely just going to crash into them and you're just going to eat body damage.

00:12:31.160 --> 00:12:32.560
<v Sean>It's not like they eat body damage.

00:12:32.680 --> 00:12:39.080
<v Sean>The only way to get rid of any particular driver is obviously shoot them with a missile that will get rid of their car.

00:12:39.080 --> 00:12:44.720
