<v Joe>You're the only one that can use missiles, which is a strange, uh, a, a, a strange note.

00:12:52.900 --> 00:13:04.340
<v Mike>Um, one other way that I found that you can try, you can try to sort of guide them into oil spills or like whatever those puddles are.

