00:13:21.960 --> 00:13:23.800
<v Joe>Um, yeah.

00:13:23.800 --> 00:13:35.580
<v Mike>I was also trying to drift at first without looking at the manual or anything, just kind of doing like a, oh, like as I'm approaching a turn, like what if I try to break and turn at the same time?

